00:30:09.380 --> 00:30:11.790
It doesn't have any labels.

00:30:11.790 --> 00:30:14.958
So this is an example of
what that data looks like.

00:30:14.958 --> 00:30:16.000
But it's a lot to digest.

00:30:16.000 --> 00:30:18.310
You probably don't want
to look at this raw,

00:30:18.310 --> 00:30:22.030
because it's a lot, unless you
want to specifically check out

00:30:22.030 --> 00:30:24.810
